# armour/man/sleeve_heavy_l: HEAVY, a vambrace 2 px proud each side of the forearm and a 3 px flared cuff (R on the cuff lip; BODY forge-fix i1: bolder at 1x), on the body's left arm.
# Traced from the arm library's own views (loco arms), one view per key, so the sleeve rides its arm in every key; a key whose forearm is hidden draws nothing.
# Generated by FORGE-LIMBS (gen_sleeves.py from rpg/art/doll/maps/arms/**); the mail sleeve maps are the template. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role overlay sleeve.heavy
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L
z 2

